<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10192] OptimizedMarshallerTest#testAllocationOverflow throws OOME instead of expected IOE</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10192</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;OptimizedMarshallerTest#_testAllocationOverflow (in current codebase muted by renaming to &lt;tt&gt;_testAllocationOverflow&lt;/tt&gt;) throws OOME instead of expected IOE when trying to marshal &lt;tt&gt;HugeObject&lt;/tt&gt; - which in turn writes 4 times &lt;tt&gt;new byte[1 &amp;lt;&amp;lt; 31 - 2]&lt;/tt&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note test javadocs say: &quot;WARNING! Requires a lot of heap space. Should not be run on CI.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
